WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 7 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.260
I'm sorry. The kitchen cook looked down on us.

2
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.460
They refused to give us a single crumb.

3
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.860
But don't worry, I'll figure something out.

4
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.060
Worst case, I'll go out to the city square and beg.

5
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.460
It's alright Sylvia. We can eat later.

6
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.860
Please don't be so hard on yourself.

7
00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:29.060
She's a literal princess, and she's willing to swallow her pride and beg for us.

8
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.460
No one has ever cared about me like this.

9
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:40.060
Beg? Are you insane? How could I let my wife woman beg on the streets for my dinner? Absolutely not!

10
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.060
Just get some sleep. We'll figure out something tomorrow.

11
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.660
Congratulations. Your Beast Mate's affinity points have significantly increased.

12
00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.260
Finn's affinity, 20.

13
00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.660
Jax's affinity, 10.

14
00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.860
Alistar's affinity, 0.

15
00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:00.060
Wait here. Let me go see if there's another way.

16
00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:13.330
Think Sylvia, think. What am I supposed to do now?

17
00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:19.150
Survival crisis detected.

18
00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:24.950
Sylvia, would you like to exchange your newly earned affinity points for a special item?

19
00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:27.550
Does it have actual food in it?

20
00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:32.950
Processing exchange. Transaction successful. Please open the box in front of you.

21
00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:05.460
Alright boys. Who wants to try some specialties from my hometown?
